      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a> implementation specific for executing <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Predicate.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Predicate</code></a> based <a href=\"query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a> against\n<a href=\"KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "针对执行基于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Predicate.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Predicate</code></a> 的 <a href=\"query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a> 的 <a href=\"QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a> 实现，该实现专门用于与 <a href=\"KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a> 交互。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"SpelCriteria.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>SpelCriteria</code></a> allows to pass on a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a> to the actual query\nprocessor.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"SpelCriteria.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>SpelCriteria</code></a> 允许将 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a> 传递给实际的查询处理器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Comparator</code></a> implementation to compare objects based on a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/PropertyPath.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>PropertyPath</code></a>.",
      "translation": "基于<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Comparator</code></a>实现的比较器，用于根据<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/PropertyPath.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>PropertyPath</code></a>对对象进行比较。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Comparator</code></a> implementation using <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a> 实现的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Comparator</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Base implementation of <a href=\"KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a> holds <a href=\"QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a> to delegate find and\ncount execution to.",
      "translation": "<KeyValueAdapter>接口的<a href=\"KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\">基本实现</a>包含一个<a href=\"QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a>，用于委托执行查找和计数操作。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
